		(uuid "41e62c59-52ca-4611-81ff-362b2dfcc89f")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1. VFD: Noritake CU20029ECPB-W1J (2x20). JP2 OPEN = M68 (HD44780) mode, 8-bit bus. JP3 open: pin 3 = NC.\n2. VFD draws 400 mA typ., up to ~800 mA inrush - power it from a separate 5 V supply, NOT from the Arduino 5V pin.\n   Arduino UNO: do not connect +5V_VFD to the UNO 5V pin while USB is plugged in. Only GND is common.\n3. C1/C2 and C3/C4 sit right at each display connector (pins 1-2).\n4. Both displays share RS, R/W, DB0-DB7; each has its own E (D11 = left, D6 = right).\n5. Keep the bus wires short (< 20 cm), especially E."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
